    harness/README.md.

  * The MDPI LaTeX class and bibliography style files under Definitions/
    (mdpi.cls, mdpi.bst, and the MDPI/ORCID logo assets), which are
    Copyright (c) MDPI and are redistributed only as required to typeset the
    manuscript.

  * Third-party Python packages listed in harness/requirements.txt, and the
    external tools invoked as baselines (Flawfinder; the CodeBERT model
    fine-tuned on Devign), each under its own license.

